<!-- ABOUT -->
                <article class="about" data-page="about" id="about">
                    <header>
                        <h2 class="h2 article-title">About me</h2>
                    </header>

                    <section class="about-text">
                        <p>
                            <b
                                >Asif Sayyed is a Data Science Specialist at
                                <a
                                    href="https://marsh.com/"
                                    target="_blank"
                                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                    style="
                                        color: inherit;
                                        text-decoration: underline;
                                        display: inline;
                                    "
                                    >Marsh</a
                                >'s Cyber Risk Intelligence Center in Mumbai</b
                            >, where he specializes in turning complex data into
                            clear, actionable solutions for the insurance
                            industry.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            With a comprehensive background in Data Science and
                            Business Analytics, Asif leverages tools like
                            Python, SQL, and Databricks to model cyber risks and
                            build robust, data-driven applications.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            He draws inspiration from the strategist Sun Tzu,
                            who wrote,
                            <i
                                >"In the midst of chaos, there is also
                                opportunity."</i
                            >
                            Approaching raw data as that chaos, Asif's work
                            focuses on uncovering the opportunities hidden
                            within it.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Moving beyond standard analysis, he actively builds
                            scalable solutions that translate complex numbers
                            into practical tools. If you are a developer,
                            recruiter, or simply curious about data science,
                            feel free to browse his portfolio and explore his
                            open-source projects.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <!--
          - service
        -->

                    <section class="service">
                        <h3 class="h3 service-title">
                            What I'm currently doing?
                        </h3>

                        <ul class="service-list">
                            <li class="service-item">
                                <div class="service-icon-box">
                                    <img
                                        src="./assets/images/icons/icon-job.svg"
                                        alt="Corporate role icon"
                                        loading="lazy"
                                        width="40"
                                        height="40"
                                    />
                                </div>
                                <div class="service-content-box">
                                    <h4 class="h4 service-item-title">
                                        Corporate Overview
                                    </h4>
                                    <p class="service-item-text">
                                        Specialist - Data Science @ Marsh at the
                                        Cyber Risk and Intelligence Center
                                        (CRIC).
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>

                            <li
                                class="service-item"
                                style="cursor: pointer"
                                onclick="
                                    window.open(
                                        'https://github.com/Asifdotexe/yoink',
                                        '_blank',
                                    )
                                "
                            >
                                <div class="service-icon-box">
                                    <ion-icon
                                        aria-hidden="true"
                                        name="code-slash-outline"
                                        style="
                                            font-size: 40px;
                                            color: var(--vibrant-green);
                                            margin: auto;
                                            display: block;
                                        "
                                    ></ion-icon>
                                </div>
                                <div class="service-content-box">
                                    <h4 class="h4 service-item-title">
                                        Open Source
                                    </h4>
                                    <p class="service-item-text">
                                        Building Yoink, an open-source project.
                                        Try it out, review the code, or
                                        contribute.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

